   {
    "id": "p_00004",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     17,
     1
    ],
    "text": "[CODE3]",
    "placeholders": {
     "CODE3": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<code><tt>#include &lt;<a href=\"../basedefs/stdio.h.html\">stdio.h</a>&gt;<br>\n<br>\nsize_t fwrite(const void *restrict</tt> <i>ptr</i><tt>, size_t</tt> <i>size</i><tt>, size_t</tt> <i>nitems</i><tt>,<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; FILE *restrict</tt> <i>stream</i><tt>);<br></tt></code>"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00005",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     19
    ],
    "text": "[A4][/A4]DESCRIPTION",
    "placeholders": {
     "A4": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_199_03\" id=\"tag_17_199_03\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00006",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The [I5]fwrite[/I5]() function shall write, from the array pointed to by [I6]ptr[/I6], up to [I7]nitems[/I7] elements whose size is\nspecified by [I8]size[/I8], to the stream pointed to by [I9]stream[/I9]. For each object, [I10]size[/I10] calls shall be made to the\n[A11][I12]fputc[/I12]()[/A11] function, taking the values (in order) from an array of [B13]unsigned char[/B13]\nexactly overlaying the object. The file-position indicator for the stream (if defined) shall be advanced by the number of bytes\nsuccessfully written. If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file-position indicator for the stream is unspecified.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I5": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I6": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I7": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I8": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I9": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I10": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A11": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/fputc.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I12": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "B13": {
      "open": "<b>",
      "close": "</b>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00007",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     5
    ],
    "text": "[S14][[A15]CX[/A15]][/S14] [IMG16] The\nlast data modification and last file status change timestamps of the file shall be marked for update between the successful\nexecution of [I17]fwrite[/I17]() and the next successful completion of a call to [A18][I19]fflush[/I19]()[/A18]\nor [A20][I21]fclose[/I21]()[/A20] on the same stream, or a call to [A22][I23]exit[/I23]()[/A22] or [A24][I25]abort[/I25]()[/A24]. [IMG26]",
    "placeholders": {
     "S14": {
      "open": "<sup>",
      "close": "</sup>",
      "translate": true
     },
