    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     41,
     1
    ],
    "text": "Because of possible differences in element length and byte ordering, files written using [I43]fwrite[/I43]() are\napplication-dependent, and possibly cannot be read using [A44][I45]fread[/I45]()[/A44] by a different\napplication or by the same application on a different processor.",
